<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on ABB.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on ABB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS says it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on ABB shares.</p>
<p>50 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,700.00 SFR	    PREMIUM	8.50 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.55 SFR		  GEARING	13.10 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 30.JAN.97-20.MAR.98   PAYDATE	30.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   ZURICH		    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
